---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Central AC Repair | Wake Forest & Rolesville, NC" description="Expert central air conditioner repair in Wake Forest, NC. Capacitors, compressors, coils, and more.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Central AC Repair</h1>
      <p>Expert central air conditioner repair in Wake Forest, NC. Capacitors, compressors, coils, and more.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>Central air systems are the backbone of home comfort in Wake Forest. When yours underperforms or fails, our technicians diagnose the root cause and restore cooling quickly.</p>
      <h2>What We Offer</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Capacitor and contactor replacement</li>
        <li>Compressor diagnosis and repair</li>
        <li>Evaporator and condenser coil service</li>
        <li>Blower motor and fan repairs</li>
        <li>Thermostat and control board issues</li>
        <li>All major brands: Carrier, Trane, Lennox, Rheem, Goodman, and more</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Ready for Fast Service?</h2>
      <p>Call or text <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>(919) 555-0199</a> for same-day AC service in Wake Forest, Rolesville, and nearby communities. Upfront pricing and a written estimate before any work begins.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call (919) 555-0199</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>